{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act38side_level_act38side_st03",
  "groupId": "act38side",
  "stageId": "act38side_st03",
  "title": "《狂歡節章程》",
  "storyCode": "PV-ST-3",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act38side/level_act38side_st03.txt",
  "sourceHash": "aa606ba1b2997fa1be59379c0bda95980e019de1a28b54a784cb321d78d942dd",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "<p=2>1100年11月9日    12:05 P.M.</>"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾埃米",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“吃飽了也要搶最後一塊”！披薩外送！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾埃米",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡有小南瓜甜椒、乳酪、薯條香腸、什錦、魔鬼辣椒，還有最最經典的番茄乳酪口味！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾埃米",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大家先來吃飯吧，餓著肚子工作會沒有力氣的。這一份給您，大帝……抱歉，我還是叫您顧問吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔~口感不錯，餅皮鬆軟又有嚼勁，肉香濃郁。有這家店的名片嗎？給我一張。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾埃米",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這是我借了港口工人們的廚房自己做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾埃米",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔，您要是喜歡的話，我可以把配方寫給您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾埃米",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別不好意思，都是應該的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾埃米",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要不是您幫忙，趕在今晚巡遊開始之前把所有受損的花車都修好，否則後果真是不堪設想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只是在想，龍門人吃不吃得慣正宗的敘拉古披薩。改天讓能天使研究一下，說不定可以加進“大地的盡頭”的菜單裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾埃米",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大帝顧問，那位邊工作邊唱歌的老師，不過來吃一點嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，大嘴巴，快過來，這裡有東西能堵住你的嘴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一時間不知道該吐槽你這個隨時隨地都要高歌一曲的臭毛病，還是你的破鑼嗓子，又或者你唱的歌本身……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這個調調是什麼，你們在雨林裡搭積木時的勞動歌？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不唱我開心不起來，工作沒動力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "肥仔，你只是悠哉地坐在一邊提供所謂的“造型指導”，真正揮汗如雨跑上跑下敲敲打打的可是我大祭司！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你有賣力的理由，我沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "誰叫你的花車在火場跟著遭了殃呢，嘖，是屁股被燒掉了對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "氣死我了氣死我了，做得一點都不酷炫就算了，還把我和那隻狼擺得那麼近！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "警察小姑娘，其他斷手斷腳的花車基本修補好了，還剩下那隻燒得就剩一堆渣渣的狼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要我說，與其要在這麼短的時間內重新製作一輛出來，不如我再花點功夫把其他花車改造得更拉風一點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "反正花車那麼多，少一隻狼肯定沒人能看出來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾埃米",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不、不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾埃米",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然敘拉古關於野獸的傳說有很多，但狼有特殊的意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾埃米",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而且市政廳很早就宣傳過花車的數量和原型，如果真的少了一輛，會引起不必要的恐慌的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "其實吧——\n喂，肥仔，不要直接往我嘴裡塞——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "唔，放了烤鳳梨？有叛逆精神。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "敘拉古的警察都要學做披薩嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾埃米",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊不是的。我爸爸在別的城市開了間披薩店，我從小就在裡面打工。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾埃米",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們店的口碑很好哦，小時候我夢到過我們在全敘拉古開了分店，甚至有一個專門的移動地塊來做總部。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾埃米",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "或許您聽過我們的廣告——“諾埃米披薩，讓您吃飽了也要搶最後一塊！”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝&大祭司",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾埃米",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾埃米",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們始終沒存夠錢開第一家分店。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾埃米",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雖然生意還不錯，也沒有客人敢不付錢吃霸王餐，但給家族的保護費幾乎就是我們全部的利潤……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾埃米",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以聽說新沃爾西尼警察學校招生，我就跑來了。當上警察後，說不定就可以保護店裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾埃米",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您是不是也想說我的想法很幼稚？其實當警察比開分店難多了，這幾天也確實接二連三發生了好多事情……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "換個角度想問題，年輕人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你當了警察，至少可以改一句更吸睛更能刺激消費的廣告詞——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“諾埃米披薩，不好吃你把我銬起來！”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾埃米",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你讓我想起我家祖瑪瑪了，年輕人總是想法很簡單，也很有幹勁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，都怪你這肥仔，突然把我拉到這裡來，我都沒來得及跟祖瑪瑪說一聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "值得我們一聚的派對並不多，大嘴巴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "更何況，派對結束之後，我們還有正經事要談。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾埃米",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "總之，還是感謝兩位！要不是你們突然出現還主動幫忙，我們真的不知道該怎麼辦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾埃米",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至於報酬，等到狂歡節結束，我會第一時間向市政廳申請的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "報酬你剛剛已經付過了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "大帝又往嘴裡塞了一塊披薩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看在披薩的份上，幫人幫到底。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "大祭司又往嘴裡塞了一塊披薩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過說真的，看著這蠢狼被燒得只剩一堆渣渣，真的讓人覺得很痛快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾埃米",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，那您……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我更討厭派對被搞砸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惆悵的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，世事無常啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惆悵的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我剛剛一路過來，其他攤位都在熱火朝天地布置，準備晚上大賺一筆，只有我們，被提前宣判了死刑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惆悵的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不管，這次的損失你一個人承擔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘴硬的合夥人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你這就有點耍賴了，我當時也是好心啊！前天突然下了那麼大一場雨，我想說能盡量減少一點損失嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惆悵的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以你放著曬在庭院裡的食材不管，衝出去推啤酒車？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘴硬的合夥人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "忙中出錯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惆悵的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啤酒車有智慧恆溫系統，又是封閉的，被雨淋到也沒關係，結果你把它推了回來，害得我好不容易搶到的攤位被別人佔了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惆悵的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在，攤位沒了，食材沒了，這哪裡是什麼狂歡節，分明是我的葬禮！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惆悵的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "早知道就該繼續拍電影，雖然那些家族的人動不動就來片場指手畫腳，但好歹有口飯吃，非要聽你這個混蛋慫恿，跑來這裡——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘴硬的合夥人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你、你又來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Zzz，Zzz……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惆悵的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原來您還沒走啊！怎麼吃完一支冰淇淋後就原地睡著了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "神父，神父？\n——我真想把您這副樣子給拍下來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿格尼爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為什麼不拍呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿格尼爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果好看的話，我肯定願意付錢的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惆悵的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿格尼爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你會拍照吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惆悵的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿格尼爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今天可是新沃爾西尼最重要的日子，每個人都會盛裝出席。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿格尼爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "假面、華服，還有巨大而神秘的花車，如果我身處其中，肯定會想拍幾張照片留念。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿格尼爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是遊行的隊伍滾滾向前，我根本沒辦法為這件事停下來。這時候要是有個專業攝影師在一旁代勞，何樂而不為呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿格尼爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "再說到時候滿大街都是賣啤酒賣冰淇淋的，你真不一定爭得過人家——說實話，你們做的冰淇淋口味滿差的，不夠甜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惆悵的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還愣著做什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘴硬的合夥人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎、怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惆悵的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "趕快回去拿相機，記得多買幾卷底片！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惆悵的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝謝您。一條尾巴裡容不下兩種皮毛，看來我和這傢伙真的不適合在一起打拚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿格尼爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "問題總會暴露的，問題也總有解決的辦法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惆悵的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我記得城裡沒有建教堂……神父，您是從哪裡來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿格尼爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "蒙特盧佩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惆悵的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "首都啊……好遠。專門趕過來參加狂歡節嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿格尼爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "受一個老朋友的委託，過來看看。她對這個活動有點在意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惆悵的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "敘拉古確實好久沒有哪座城市舉行過這麼盛大的活動了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惆悵的商人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "同樣是慶祝新生，隔壁萊塔尼亞的女皇慶典可是一年一次，而且聽說都是萬民齊聚，排場一次比一次大……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿格尼爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊，敘拉古好久沒有哪座城市舉行過這麼盛大的活動了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿格尼爾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不要下雨才好，不然維持秩序可就難囉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……英格麗女士，你這是在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這塊布料應該沒用了吧？我從廢布箱裡隨手拿的，用來擦一下刀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我可以幫你找一塊質地更軟一點的純棉布。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒那個必要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今天晚上就是狂歡節，幾乎每條街上都安排了慶典活動，你就不用一直待在德蒙塔諾了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我答應了瓦古，要替你解決麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是你查到了盧奇諾的下落，也是你陪我到威尼斯的宅邸接他回來。你幫的忙已經夠多了，我應該對你表示感謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒必要謝我，翁貝托。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說服了老威尼斯不再追究盧奇諾的人是你，是你自己救回了那孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說起來，那孩子還是把自己關在房間裡？一直沒看見他，最好不要是又跑出去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "跑出去就跑出去了吧，這兩天經歷了太多事情，他的年紀還小，總得花點時間來整理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "或許一直以來，我都把他管得太嚴了一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "或許他只是一時間沒辦法想清楚該怎麼看待你，自己的爺爺，一個老裁縫，曾是讓敘拉古的家族老大們都無法安眠的“剪裁師”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，並不重要。重要的是他從鬼門關走了這一遭，知道了這種種往事後，要怎麼看待自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我又能陪他多久呢？他必須要想清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好了，英格麗女士，我們也就此告別吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其實你已經知道了，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當年那個傷害了你女兒的兇手到底是誰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵，為什麼這麼說？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈哈，英格麗女士，你忘了，我也曾經是個殺手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的武器明明很鋒利，不需要保養，你也沒有類似的習慣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一個殺手，突然擦拭自己的刀，要嘛是打算封存它，要嘛是準備用它去殺人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "倒也沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……雖然還只是猜測，但也算是有了一些收穫，所以我說你不用感謝我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你來到新沃爾西尼，留在德蒙塔諾，是為了換取當年的真相——到底是誰策劃了那場刺殺，在那場城邦內亂中傷害了麗薩小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這是你和瓦古的約定，但既然你已經知道了答案，它也就沒了繼續的意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "更何況我已經沒有什麼麻煩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "遊戲還沒有結束，所謂的“獠牙”還在城內，我和她們交過手，兩個孩子，但身手都不弱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我能找到她們，她們自然也能找到你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "翁貝托，你老了也病了，以你現在的身體狀況……你會死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "英格麗女士，那本來就是我快要走到的終點，你沒辦法幫我避開它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "英格麗",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "翁貝托",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "起碼今天晚上，我想安靜地待一陣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "<p=2>1100年11月9日    4:00 P.M.</>\n我們就先走了——\n欸，新面孔，之前那個調度員呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調度員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……半小時前剛換班，他現在大概正在排練。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "港口工人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調度員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們不知道？人家以前可是米蘭劇場的駐場樂手，吹得一手好薩克斯風，狂歡節剛籌備的時候他就被邀請進花車的隨行樂隊了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調度員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我懂了，他一直瞞著，就是想第二天拿著印著他照片的報紙向你們炫耀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "港口工人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這傢伙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "港口工人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以今晚是你值班嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調度員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我剛來嘛。還好因為狂歡節，新沃爾西尼港今晚會進入特殊作業狀態，沒有平常那麼忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調度員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我把收音機開到最大，隔空感受一下現場的氣氛，也算參與了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調度員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們快走吧，不然在隊伍裡就搶不到好位置了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "港口工人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "辛苦了，再見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調度員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼～"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你差點說漏嘴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“調度員”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不然你來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我可沒有在市長的就職宣傳片裡當過臨演，我沒有那個演技。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“調度員”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "能一樣嗎？我在那裡面演的是自己，再說隨時能再重拍一次，剛剛要是露餡，安東尼奧今晚的所有安排就都暴露了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“調度員”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今晚對你我，對整個威尼斯家族都很重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“調度員”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等我們真正掌控了這座城市，安東尼奧會兌現他的諾言，支持你……怎麼說的去了，重振西西里的榮光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我只希望自己不要和卡爾有同樣的下場……\n我們的頂級樂手呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“調度員”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在地獄裡吹薩克斯風呢——就是那邊的貨櫃，屍體等事情結束後再一起處理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那接下來調度台就交給你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“調度員”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“調度員”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今晚港口內所有車輛的進出都必須接受調度台的特別審查，威尼斯載具公司的車臨時加進了名單。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“調度員”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "移動城市的定位系統已經關閉，只保留了一個加密頻道。今晚除了家族的那艘陸行艦，所有載具都不能靠近這座城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其他的人手就在週邊。一旦陸行艦到達城市附近，你這邊開始接駁，新沃爾西尼港所有不相干的人都會消失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“調度員”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "安東尼奧那邊呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老闆還需要我們操心嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還有幾個小時……享受今晚吧，新沃爾西尼人，享受真正的狂歡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘖，這開幕詞太俗氣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“調度員”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "聲音來自頭頂。\n貨櫃上方的吊機橫樑上，白狼饒有興味地看著驚愕的兩人。她皺眉撇嘴，像一個實在忍受不了演出而出聲打斷的觀眾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“調度員”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是誰？你一直在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“調度員”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "甘比諾，幹掉她！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "俗氣你還鼓掌？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不是給了我第一個小反轉嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過甘比諾，我還滿期待你朝我動手的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也想。但我不做成功機率低到可以忽略不計的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈哈，你的同伴呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "卡彭？在幫小威尼斯處理其他事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很忙嘛，西西里人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "拉普蘭德，你到底要做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們已經偷偷幫了你不少忙了，今天晚上，我沒辦法再——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃，我的意思是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小威尼斯已經把整個家族在新沃爾西尼一年的心血全部投了進來，事到如今，哪怕你要搞什麼破壞，我也幫不上忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你還是自以為很瞭解我啊，甘比諾。而且都是老熟人了，我怎麼會為難你呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "照常執行你老闆交代的任務就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他想做的事情和我想做的事情並不衝突，說不定我其實是想幫他一把？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "狂歡節嘛，每個人對這座新城市的願望都該被實現。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以你都不用打死地上這個傢伙的——下手太快了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "下次注意，別那麼急著表現自己還是一個壞傢伙，難怪你的市民積分還沒有卡彭多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "唉。\n在那之前還有什麼要我做的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我有東西掉在了威尼斯的宅邸，先去幫我拿來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一個禮盒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……難道說，是那個小裁縫隨身帶著的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "另外，去多弄一些彩帶、氣球和射燈什麼的，快去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
